Package: starship-control
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Starship Control Team <team@starshipcontrol.dev>
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1, libssl3, libsqlite3-0, libpipewire-0.3-0
Description: Native Linux AI Agent Orchestrator & Command Center
 Starship Control is a local-first, native Linux AI agent orchestrator and
 unified command center for desktop applications (Easy Edits Pro, ScreenStudio Pro,
 Audio Labs Pro, Net Watch Pro, and Agentic Tuneup Pro).
 .
 Features dual-engine support for local GGUF weights (Vulkan/ROCm) and cloud APIs,
 dual-surface Cockpit + Floating HUD interfaces, and multi-tier cryptographic safety gating.
